WEBVTT

00:00:00.840 --> 00:00:04.010
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:07.280
When you watch Kaleido Star, I want you
to keep your room brightly lit,

00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.610
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.280
Well, well, well.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.650
Hello everyone, I'm Yuri Killian.

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:17.720
Today is the day the Circus Festival
will take place.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:21.020
Three years ago, on this day,
I was here with Layla.

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:24.530
And our glory also started from here.

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:26.360
This time, my partner is Sora.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.230
There's no way to erase the mistakes
I made in the past,

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:32.930
but this time I intend to do everything in
my power for Sora, Layla, and Kaleido Stage.

00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:37.230
But, I wonder if Sora really can
tolerate this cruel stage.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:48.120
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the beginning is
red and black passions</i>

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:48.120
<i>Tattoo Kiss hajimari wa aka to kuro no Passion</i>

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:55.420
<i>Sometimes, we rely on our contrary hearts</i>

00:00:48.120 --> 00:00:55.420
