New Wings

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:10.140
<i>There is no place for ambiguous answers in love</i>

00:01:02.730 --> 00:01:10.140
<i>Koi ni aimai na kotae wa iranai</i>

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>Even while pretending not to see the
impossible reality, we bet</i>

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>Arienai genjitsu minai furi shite mo Bet</i>

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:23.880
<i>Hard to obtain truth. Can you feel me now?</i>

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:23.880
<i>Egatai shinjitsu Can U feel me now?</i>

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:28.420
<i>Say what to myself who gets excited easily?</i>

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:28.420
<i>Nesshiyasui jibun ni Say What?</i>

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.790
<i>I'm confused, what to say</i>

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.790
<i>Tomadou iibun</i>

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:41.000
<i>Dreamin' the never-waking dream,
the falling fate</i>

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:41.000
<i>Dreamin' samenai yume ochiteku sadame</i>

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.770
<i>Don't stop lovin' can't stop lovin' you
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.770
<i>Don't stop lovin' Can't stop lovin' U
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:56.120
<i>I believe in you even if I lose everything for it</i>

00:01:48.310 --> 00:01:56.120
<i>Believe in U hikikae ni subete ushinatte mo</i>

00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:01.650
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' you
No no no</i>

00:01:56.120 --> 00:02:01.650
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' U
No no no</i>

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.260
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.260
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.200
Too slow.

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:25.250
It's too early this time!

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:30.090
"Cruel Amazing Festival"

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:33.220
Cruel Amazing Festival

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:33.220
"Cruel Amazing Festival"

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:36.020
Cruel Amazing Festival

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:41.790
The school Yuri's attending
should be around here, but...

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:48.900
I found him.

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:50.770
Why don't we stop here today?

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.340
Not yet.

00:02:52.340 --> 00:02:56.410
Okay, then, one more hour.
Then let's end today's training.

00:02:56.410 --> 00:02:58.710
Resting is another part of practice, after all.

00:02:58.710 --> 00:02:59.920
Yes.

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:03.790
So this is the practice room for
the school Yuri is attending.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:06.520
What kind of maneuver are they working on?

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:09.450
Anyway, I'm glad to know Sora is safe.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:15.700
Mr. Mute and Miss Alice, thank you
for helping us today.

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:18.370
You're welcome. By the way,
can we come tomorrow too?

00:03:18.370 --> 00:03:19.670
Oh... You don't have to.

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:23.310
We learned a lot. So, please? Say it's all right.

00:03:23.310 --> 00:03:24.710
Is it okay with you?

00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:28.310
Since they're nice enough to offer their help,
it's impolite to say no. Don't you think so?

00:03:28.310 --> 00:03:30.510
Yes... That's true.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:31.880
Then please come and help us.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:33.550
Great!

00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:34.950
See you tomorrow, then.

00:03:34.950 --> 00:03:36.620
Yes. Good night.

00:03:36.620 --> 00:03:38.420
Good night.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.660
Sora, I'll walk you to your hotel.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:43.930
Well, but I didn't book a hotel.

00:03:43.930 --> 00:03:44.790
What?!

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:46.390
Then, why don't you stay at my place?

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:47.300
WHAT?!

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.970
Well... but... it's like I'm asking you too much.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:50.400
Hi, Sora!

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.330
Oh Ken?!

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.330
Hi, Sora!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.530
What a coincidence!

00:03:52.530 --> 00:03:54.200
What are you doing?

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:55.970
Well... I was... taking a walk.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:03:57.810
Taking a walk?

00:03:57.810 --> 00:04:00.040
But you're breathing hard. Are you okay?

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.440
Yeah...

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:04.780
Anyway, if you need a place to stay,
I'll find a place for you.

00:04:04.780 --> 00:04:05.850
Well, but...

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:07.950
It doesn't bother me even one bit
if you stay at my place.

00:04:07.950 --> 00:04:10.650
No, Sora is a part of the Kaleido Stage cast.

00:04:10.650 --> 00:04:13.090
Kaleido Stage will look after her.

00:04:13.090 --> 00:04:15.060
Thank you for everything!

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:16.620
Get a good night's sleep.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:17.610
Okay!

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.230
Yes, there is.

00:04:22.230 --> 00:04:23.570
Oh, good.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:25.470
Sora, you've got a room.

00:04:25.470 --> 00:04:27.570
Really? Thank you, Ken.

00:04:27.570 --> 00:04:29.940
So shall we charge the room to Kaleido Stage?

00:04:29.940 --> 00:04:32.170
No. Please charge it to me, Ken Robbins.

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:35.380
And please keep this secret from her.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:36.710
Yes, sir.

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:43.450
Angel's maneuver. I'll make sure
to perfect that maneuver.

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:45.850
And I'm going to win.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:54.100
So I guess the ones I need to watch out
for are Mr. & Mrs. Patrova

00:04:54.100 --> 00:04:57.930
and the street performer pair, Mute and Alice.

00:04:57.930 --> 00:05:02.140
Well, I did refine my Demon Spiral
even further, after all.

00:05:02.140 --> 00:05:05.160
We'll be the victors, no mistake.

00:05:05.510 --> 00:05:06.810
What is this?

00:05:06.810 --> 00:05:11.180
I'm going to compete against the
maneuvers of the world's top stars,

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:13.650
and yet I'm not quite fired up.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:17.520
Something is missing. I wonder why.

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:35.540
Don't try to force a jump.

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:36.640
Okay!

00:05:37.140 --> 00:05:41.230
Feel out the moment when your body
gains the most power, then jump!

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:46.410
And maintain a beautiful pose as you go up.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.450
Sora...

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:51.350
Are you aware of your weak point?

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:54.490
Yes. Ken told me before.

00:05:54.490 --> 00:05:59.330
Since I've only been doing big maneuvers,
my body's unbalanced.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:04.070
Yes. But even with only the basics
they teach at circus school,

00:06:04.070 --> 00:06:06.970
you shouldn't lose this much balance.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:11.860
In Japan, there are hardly any
circus schools, so I haven't gone.

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:14.240
Really?

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:17.080
To think she was able to perform the
legendary great maneuver without...

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:21.780
I'll work hard. I'll endure it
no matter how tough it is.

00:06:21.780 --> 00:06:23.850
This maneuver is called the "Angel's Maneuver"

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:30.220
because it gives the impression of weightless,
just like the feathers of an angel's wings.

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:35.700
Just like a ballerina, in order to make
your body seem light as a feather

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:40.300
and maintain a beautiful pose,
you need strong grounding in the basics.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:44.340
I even endured Mr. Leon's
special training and passed!

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:46.710
Just like I did then, no matter
how tough it gets,

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:49.540
I'll cover for my lack of basics
through force of will!

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:52.410
So, please, Yuri!

00:06:53.920 --> 00:06:57.520
Sora, when it's you saying it,
I start to feel like you really can.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:00.620
All right. Then, let's continue practice.

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:01.590
Yes!

00:07:02.420 --> 00:07:07.530
I have to master my timing.
And I have to pose beautifully.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:10.200
What?! What does this mean?

00:07:10.200 --> 00:07:12.800
Why's Sora's name registered?

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:15.770
Her partner is Yuri.

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:19.600
I see... there was that method.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:26.680
So she still hasn't given up on victory.

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:28.670
Interesting.

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:33.720
I know now... what was missing in this festival.

00:07:33.720 --> 00:07:36.490
Sora... it was you!

00:07:36.490 --> 00:07:39.490
Fool, try to knock me down by crashing into me!

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:40.650
OKAY!

00:07:41.700 --> 00:07:43.600
Please crash into my back.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:44.800
What?

00:07:44.800 --> 00:07:48.460
And I was this close too...

00:07:52.270 --> 00:07:53.210
Yes!

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:54.000
Too fast!

00:07:55.310 --> 00:07:57.680
Too slow! Pay more attention!

00:07:57.680 --> 00:07:58.580
Yes!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:00.950
Demon Spiral!

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:03.180
Her move has changed.

00:08:03.890 --> 00:08:06.520
What's this feeling?

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:08.660
I can hardly wait for the festival.

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:11.630
I want to compete with Sora in the festival, soon!

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:19.330
I want to compete with Sora.

00:08:22.540 --> 00:08:23.870
Don't forget to pose!

00:08:24.410 --> 00:08:25.800
Yes!

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.760
In only a few days, she managed
to reach this point...

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:43.260
Impressive as ever.

00:08:43.260 --> 00:08:46.360
Now, if she can just maintain
that beautiful pose...

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:49.420
Amazing... I've never seen that maneuver.

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:10.980
It really looks like an angel's wings.

00:09:13.150 --> 00:09:14.680
I can do this!

00:09:23.770 --> 00:09:27.290
The day has finally come.
Everything will be determined today.

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:29.300
Sora!

00:09:30.270 --> 00:09:31.970
Hi, Sora!

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:34.540
Mia, Miss Sarah, you came?

00:09:34.540 --> 00:09:35.470
Where is Anna?

00:09:37.250 --> 00:09:41.220
Un, deux, trois, un, deux, trois...

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.340
un chien!

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:49.550
Mr. Charlie. He's the real thing!

00:09:50.120 --> 00:09:54.100
It seems she was able to meet
the clown she admired, Mr. Charlie.

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:55.660
Anna looks happy.

00:09:55.660 --> 00:09:57.430
Yuri, it's been a long time, hasn't it?

00:09:57.430 --> 00:09:58.000
Yeah.

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.270
Thank you for coming. I know
traveling expenses are not cheap.

00:10:00.270 --> 00:10:03.540
If you're concerned about travel expenses,
Miss Sarah negotiated that with the Boss for us.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.310
So all expenses are paid by Kaleido Stage.

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:07.480
What? Really?

00:10:07.480 --> 00:10:09.710
So I'm the only one paying everything
out of my own pocket.

00:10:09.710 --> 00:10:11.650
Well, I guess, there's nothing I can do now.

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:13.980
Sora, make sure you win!

00:10:13.980 --> 00:10:16.210
So we can participate in the festival
together three years from now.

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:18.580
Yes!

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:45.910
Oh!

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.450
I forgot to bring my good luck pendant!

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:51.420
Oh... I might be done for.

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:55.350
Ouch!

00:10:56.260 --> 00:10:57.490
What are you doing?!

00:10:57.490 --> 00:10:59.550
Oh, excuse me.

00:10:59.990 --> 00:11:02.730
Hey, that's Yuri Killian.

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:03.700
It sure is...

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:05.770
He should stay in retirement.

00:11:05.770 --> 00:11:07.340
The partner he's with...

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:11.640
Isn't she the girl who paired with Layla Hamilton
in that legendary great maneuver?

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:12.970
Yep, that's right.

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:14.680
So they're a pair of big shots.

00:11:14.680 --> 00:11:16.730
That stinks.

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:31.750
Sora...

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.590
May...

00:11:36.060 --> 00:11:39.570
Sora, I see you don't know
when to give up either.

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:41.140
We're going to win!

00:11:41.140 --> 00:11:43.470
We will not lose to the two of you!

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.560
I can't wait to see the result.

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:48.240
Leon...

00:11:48.240 --> 00:11:50.850
Yuri Killian...

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:53.750
Hi. Long time, no see.

00:11:53.750 --> 00:11:59.410
What? Did you meet each other when you
participated in the festival three years ago?

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:01.420
Leon?

00:12:02.860 --> 00:12:05.760
Whoever thought that we'd see
each other at this place again?

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:09.500
Perhaps a match with you is
my unavoidable destiny.

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.070
Then, do you want to pair with me?

00:12:12.070 --> 00:12:15.160
With me as I am now, the one
they call the God of Death?

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:17.140
You have changed.

00:12:17.140 --> 00:12:19.240
I learned from you.

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:23.080
You taught me what I need to do to
climb to the top in this world.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:26.600
You should place more value
in your current partner.

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:29.480
What's going on?

00:12:29.480 --> 00:12:33.750
Did something happen between
Leon and Mr. Yuri three years ago?

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:37.280
I... don't know. I don't. I don't.

00:12:37.630 --> 00:12:41.760
By the way, maybe, you don't know
that Miss Layla is here.

00:12:41.760 --> 00:12:42.760
Really?

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:46.560
Yes. To present the trophy to the winners.

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:53.300
I wonder which one of us is going to
receive the trophy from Miss Layla.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:06.450
And now, for the opening of this
International Circus Festival,

00:13:06.450 --> 00:13:10.860
we'd like the previous winner,
Miss Layla Hamilton, to say a few words!

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:13.560
Layla!

00:13:14.460 --> 00:13:17.630
This is a very cruel place.

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:22.240
But there's also a step forward that we can't
take unless we overcome this place.

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:24.970
Compete with each other, train each other,
improve each other,

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:28.610
and in order to take the first step
toward your dream,

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:30.630
give this everything you have.

00:14:02.580 --> 00:14:05.280
Sorry, sorry. My hand slipped.

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.780
But I see they don't call you
the God of Death for nothing.

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:11.680
Even if you destroy your partner,
you're certainly not destroyed.

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:26.470
Entry No. 5, Mr. & Mrs. Patrova.

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:34.430
Mr. & Mrs. Patrova always look like
such a happily married couple.

00:14:34.880 --> 00:14:36.810
Very soon, it will be May and Leon's turn.

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:39.050
Then after that, it will be Mute and Alice.

00:14:39.050 --> 00:14:40.920
Then Sora's turn will be after that.

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:44.390
Oh... This is more nerve wracking
than when I'm in competition.

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:46.080
I know, I know.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:51.360
Sora, you want some water?

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.990
Oh, thank you.

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.300
What's wrong?

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:59.230
Well... Since Mr. Mute and Alice
aren't here yet, I wonder what happened.

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.970
Now that you mention it...

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:03.570
Leave them alone.
Don't worry about other people.

00:15:03.570 --> 00:15:07.580
But they helped me practice every day.

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:09.780
If something happened to them
because of that...

00:15:09.780 --> 00:15:13.050
Oh... Did you exploit your rivals' goodwill?

00:15:13.050 --> 00:15:15.280
For you, that's not half bad.

00:15:15.550 --> 00:15:18.550
You're wrong. I didn't mean it like that.

00:15:18.550 --> 00:15:20.920
What? Don't pretend to be little
Miss Goody Two-Shoes.

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:24.450
In the end, it's the same as if
you used them, isn't it?

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:27.620
It'd be nice if they just don't show up.

00:15:29.260 --> 00:15:30.260
Let's go.

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:31.790
Yes.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:36.370
I never meant...

00:15:36.370 --> 00:15:38.440
I'll step out and check on them.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:41.510
No. Leave them alone.

00:15:41.510 --> 00:15:42.740
Mr. Yuri...

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:44.050
They'll be here.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:45.310
What?

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:48.520
Sorry for being late. No. 8, Mute and Alice.

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:51.420
Be ready and stand by in the waiting room.

00:15:52.020 --> 00:15:53.610
They made it.

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:57.160
Mr. Mute and Ms. Alice, I'm glad you made it.

00:15:59.730 --> 00:16:02.130
Oh, nice... costumes.

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:04.930
Both of you look like... angels...

00:16:05.200 --> 00:16:06.630
That's right.

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:10.870
Excuse us, but we will do the
Angel's Maneuver before you do.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:15.040
Since you used us, don't you think it's only fair?

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:17.340
Oh... I never meant...

00:16:17.340 --> 00:16:20.920
Did you think we'd just help you
with good intentions?

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:26.420
In order to make everyone's
dream come true, we cannot lose.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:29.510
We did nothing against the rules.

00:16:36.060 --> 00:16:38.500
Sora, are you all right?

00:16:38.500 --> 00:16:42.800
Yes, I'm all right. What's wrong with me?

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:45.140
I felt a little sick.

00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:47.640
Oh... but I think I'm...

00:16:47.640 --> 00:16:49.480
I'm fine now. So...

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:52.050
I told you, don't screw up the timing!

00:16:52.050 --> 00:16:54.180
I did it right!

00:16:54.180 --> 00:16:57.150
If we can't win this year,
we don't have another chance.

00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:58.450
I already know that.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:01.290
Honestly. I hate that Kaleido Stage.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:06.260
Finally, after Layla Hamilton retired,
they had to send two pairs this year.

00:17:06.260 --> 00:17:08.260
Oh, you're here...

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:11.770
Thanks to you, our dream broke into pieces.

00:17:11.770 --> 00:17:13.170
Thanks a lot.

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.140
Are you satisfied?

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:19.540
Nobody is wrong. This is that kind of world.

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:21.510
You were prepared for this, weren't you?

00:17:21.510 --> 00:17:22.610
Yes.

00:17:22.610 --> 00:17:24.910
Well, it's almost time to go.

00:17:25.580 --> 00:17:27.100
Yes.

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:31.620
This is a very cruel place.

00:17:31.620 --> 00:17:35.650
But there's also a step forward that we
can't take unless we overcome this place.

00:17:36.190 --> 00:17:40.060
And in order to take the first step
towards my dream...

00:17:45.400 --> 00:17:47.870
Demon!

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:50.460
Spiral!

00:17:51.940 --> 00:17:53.540
What kind of maneuver is this?!

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:54.870
Can he grab her?

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:56.400
It's impossible.

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:07.690
It's even more amazing than before.

00:18:07.690 --> 00:18:09.820
The hall is dead silent.

00:18:09.820 --> 00:18:12.330
Everyone's been enchanted by a demon.

00:18:12.330 --> 00:18:13.590
By a demon...

00:18:22.940 --> 00:18:28.080
What is this? I feel out of place.

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:31.080
It should be the same applause as usual,

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:34.670
but I'm afraid to win this applause.

00:18:37.850 --> 00:18:40.990
During the practice, we almost
managed perfection.

00:18:40.990 --> 00:18:43.190
So, we're going to perfect this here.

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:44.490
We can do it!

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:48.400
The Angel's Maneuver...

00:18:48.400 --> 00:18:50.860
No, this isn't even close to
the Angel's Maneuver.

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:55.570
Alice!

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:01.700
Alice!

00:19:08.150 --> 00:19:10.750
Mute, hold on!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.420
Ouch...

00:19:12.420 --> 00:19:14.390
I screwed up.

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:16.550
Mute...

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:21.730
Mr. Mute...

00:19:21.730 --> 00:19:25.230
We never thought of imitating someone.

00:19:25.230 --> 00:19:27.300
But, because you suddenly
decided to participate...

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:29.440
Stop, Alice.

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:31.770
Sorry, Sora.

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:42.020
We want to win in the festival and
get the world's attention,

00:19:42.020 --> 00:19:44.180
and organize a performance team with
these guys right here, and travel.

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:45.650
That is our dream.

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:52.620
Excuse us, but we will do the
Angel's Maneuver before you do.

00:19:54.030 --> 00:19:57.160
In the end, it's same as if you used them, isn't it?

00:19:58.430 --> 00:20:01.660
Thanks to you, our dream broke
into pieces. Thanks a lot.

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:05.230
No...

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:10.300
No. This isn't the place I was aiming for.

00:20:11.410 --> 00:20:14.280
The stage I was aiming for is...

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:20.380
The stage I saw with my mother and father
was more fun, and...

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:29.060
Sorry, Miss Layla...
I should never have come here.

00:20:33.970 --> 00:20:35.730
She's not coming down.

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:37.800
Why?

00:20:38.410 --> 00:20:40.310
The Angel's Maneuver...

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:42.040
I think I heard about it before.

00:20:42.040 --> 00:20:43.840
Angel's Maneuver?

00:20:46.810 --> 00:20:47.980
Sora!

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:48.540
Give me your hands!

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:51.810
Can you still continue?

00:20:52.590 --> 00:20:55.990
Sorry... I can't.

00:20:57.020 --> 00:20:58.150
Sora...

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:01.860
She's going to quit?

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.560
Sora... Is she crying?

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.370
Isn't it the Angel's Maneuver?

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.840
I've never seen it before.

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:11.840
I didn't know Kaleido Stage had
that kind of talent.

00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:14.310
I wonder why she quit in the middle of it.

00:21:14.310 --> 00:21:17.480
If she did it all the way through,
she might have won.

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:20.210
What? Did she just give up?

00:21:21.020 --> 00:21:24.080
Mastering the Angel's Maneuver to that extent...

00:21:35.560 --> 00:21:36.960
Come in.

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:42.440
Well...

00:21:42.440 --> 00:21:45.440
Miss Layla, I'm sorry.

00:21:45.440 --> 00:21:48.430
I can't believe you withdrew. You're the worst.

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:54.170
You disgraced the festival.

00:21:54.380 --> 00:21:59.280
You ran away from the stage
where a serious match was.

00:22:01.020 --> 00:22:03.220
I'm disappointed in you, Sora.

00:22:04.290 --> 00:22:06.620
I'm sorry.

00:22:11.570 --> 00:22:18.570
I thought walking Miss Layla's path
could take me to my dream,

00:22:18.570 --> 00:22:22.440
but I don't know anymore.

00:22:23.180 --> 00:22:27.200
What should I aim for?

00:22:31.820 --> 00:22:35.120
<i>All kinds of hard luck flocks your way
as if it's spurring you on</i>

00:22:31.820 --> 00:22:35.120
<i>Sekasu you ni muragaru Hard luck</i>

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:38.350
<i>Swept away by it, time is over</i>

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:38.350
<i>Nagasarete Time is over</i>

00:22:39.360 --> 00:22:42.160
<i>Just as it was predicted, take it easy</i>

00:22:39.360 --> 00:22:42.160
<i>Yokoku douri Take it easy</i>

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:46.600
<i>I will get you out right away</i>

00:22:42.160 --> 00:22:46.600
<i>Tsuredasu yo imasugu</i>

00:22:46.600 --> 00:22:48.300
<i>Hurry up (Here we go)</i>

00:22:46.600 --> 00:22:48.300
<i>Hurry up (here we go)</i>

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:50.270
<i>Forcibly only (Drive with the fastest speed)</i>

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:50.270
<i>Gouin only (saisoku drive)</i>

00:22:50.270 --> 00:22:53.540
<i>The view I look down at every day is the best</i>

00:22:50.270 --> 00:22:53.540
<i>Nichijo miorosu best view</i>

00:22:53.910 --> 00:22:55.980
<i>Sunset point (Favorite)</i>

00:22:53.910 --> 00:22:55.980
<i>Sunset point (favorite)</i>

00:22:55.980 --> 00:22:57.880
<i>Harbor light (Stormy night)</i>

00:22:55.980 --> 00:22:57.880
<i>Harbor light (stormy night)</i>

00:22:57.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>Escape for the sake of tomorrow</i>

00:22:57.880 --> 00:23:01.680
<i>Asuno tame ni escape</i>

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:08.360
<i>Even I don't have a vacation,
I've got an oasis</i>

00:23:02.580 --> 00:23:08.360
<i>Bakansu nashi demo oashisu wa get</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.780
<i>I'll turn off the cell phone
and charge my love</i>

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:14.780
<i>Keitai off tte ai o charge shite</i>

00:23:15.400 --> 00:23:19.630
<i>Because some pain,
you can't soothe with just kindness</i>

00:23:15.400 --> 00:23:19.630
<i>Yasashisa dake ja iyasenai itami mo aru kara</i>

00:23:19.630 --> 00:23:23.500
<i>We are alone. We pass each other</i>

00:23:19.630 --> 00:23:23.500
<i>We are alone. Surechigau</i>

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:24.900
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:23.940 --> 00:23:24.900
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.170
<i>At the far end of regret,
I encounter my true heart</i>

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.170
<i>Koukai no hate ni deau true heart</i>

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:37.550
<i>Whether I'm crying or laughing,
I will be with you</i>

00:23:30.810 --> 00:23:37.550
<i>Naite mo waratte mo I'll be with U</i>

00:23:40.590 --> 00:23:42.890
Next Kaleido Star: New Wings

00:23:43.660 --> 00:23:46.530
Sora, do you really intend to just
end things like this?

00:23:46.530 --> 00:23:49.890
And so, I ended up coming back to Japan.

00:23:50.300 --> 00:23:52.030
My old friends...

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:53.470
Welcome back, Sora.

00:23:53.470 --> 00:23:55.100
A loving family....

00:23:55.100 --> 00:23:56.690
Welcome back, Sora.

00:23:57.370 --> 00:23:59.930
This... this is fine.

